# Cloudflare Pages security headers (applied to every response).
# CSP notes:
#  - script-src 'self' + one hash: all JS is hashed same-origin bundles and the
#    service worker is same-origin. The only inline script is the tiny theme
#    bootstrap in index.html, allowed by its exact sha256 hash
#    (src/securityHeaders.test.ts fails if the script and hash drift apart).
#  - style-src 'unsafe-inline': the app uses inline style attributes for
#    progress-bar widths and CSS custom properties. Fonts are self-hosted.
#  - img-src: question diagram images are bundled locally under /exam-images;
#    data:/blob: cover canvas/texture sources; i.ytimg.com serves the
#    Workplace Tutorials video thumbnails.
#  - frame-src: Workplace Tutorials embeds play from youtube-nocookie.com, and
#    only after the viewer presses Play.
#  - connect-src 'self': the only network calls are the same-origin /api routes.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-XGveDDUZdww36atTbyeAIpwOSV+azQbNhyLFi8FPcgg='; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://i.ytimg.com; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; worker-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()
